==English==

===Verb===
'''[[read]] [[somebody]] the [[riot]] [[act]]'''

# {{idiom}} To [[scold]] or [[berate]] somebody; to [[reprimand]].
#:''She really '''read him the riot act''' about his smoking habit.''

